You want to manage shipping rates by city and want to show cities dropdown instead of user input of city? This plugin is totally for you to manage cities and shipping fee. You can easily add list of cities and shipping cost and show city list on checkout. Checkout will calculate shipping fee by selected city automatically.

== Description ==

**Shipping Rates by City** is the most advanced shipping plugin for WooCommerce stores allowing you to calculate the shipping costs based on selected city. It will allow you to manage city list and shipping cost as well as you can show list of cities in dropdown.<br>
If you want to allow just selected cities to ship order. it's best fit for you. 
<br><br>

**KEY BENEFITS OF HAVING FLATE SHIPPING RATES BY CITY**

* Manage shipping cities
* Block cities you don't want to ship orders or sell items
* Manage city based flate shipping charges easily

**How it work?**
* goto woocommerce > settings > shipping
* select Shipping Rates by City
* Enable plugin and add cities list 
* save settings

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/plugin-name` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
1. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
1. Use the WooCommerce -> Settings -> shipping -> City Flate Rates
1. Complete given form and submit
1. it's ready to use

